  "description": "Construction of a new three storey building for educational use as part of Hammersmith Academy (to include space for specialist SEND provision), alterations to and refurbishment of existing Children's Centre building including the change of use of the Children's Centre floor space (Use Class E(e)) to education use as part of Hammersmith Academy (Use Class F1(a)), and associated hard and soft landscape works including works to and replacement boundary treatments.",
  "subdivision_of_building": "The existing two-storey Children’s Centre will undergo refurbishment, incorporating a new reception area and administrative offices through the reconfiguration of existing rooms. Nursery spaces will be retained, and a secure demarcation line will be introduced to separate the nursery from the Academy’s administrative areas. These works will not affect the whole building.",
