          "open_space_designation": "Local Open Spaces",
          "description": "The proposed site is the only site capable of accommodating the new school building. Although the site falls within the Cathnor Park Open Space designation according to the Local Plan policies map, the site itself is not publicly accessible. It is fenced off from the public park and forms part of the play space for the Nursery, as well as the Nursery building itself. It therefore operates as part of the wider school site, rather than an area of usable public open space at present. While the scheme will introduce built form onto a largely undeveloped part of the site, it is important to note that the space is not ‘open’ in publicly accessible or visual terms.  Furthermore, the play space will be enhanced with the introduction of climbing and interactive features to the nursery woodland area to the rear of the site. The quality of the Open Space will therefore be enhanced and will provide effective screening to minimise views from Cathnor Park. ",
